      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "古歌：“恋人不得见，病势日危笃。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "An old poem says: When one cannot see the beloved, the illness grows more grave day by day.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03708",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "除却两相逢，更无愈病药。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Apart from the two lovers meeting, there is no medicine that can cure the sickness.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03708",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "见《拾遗集》。",
